 To retrieve the username from a JSON Web Token (JWT) in an ASP.NET C# WebAPI, you can follow these steps:

1. First, make sure that you have the `Microsoft.IdentityModel.Tokens` package installed in your project. You can install it via NuGet Package Manager or by running the following command in the Package Manager Console:

```bash
Install-Package Microsoft.IdentityModel.Tokens
```

